Connected to "PRIMCA"
Connected as SYSDBA.
DGMGRL> CREATE CONFIGURATION 'CAOCIPR_DG' AS PRIMARY DATABASE IS 'PRIMCA' CONNECT IDENTIFIER IS PRIMCA;
Configuration "CAOCIPR_DG" created with primary database "PRIMCA"
DGMGRL> ADD DATABASE 'STDBYCA' AS CONNECT IDENTIFIER IS STDBYCA MAINTAINED AS PHYSICAL;
Database "STDBYCA" added

